Spartronics Robotics FIRST Team 4915 at Bainbridge High will compete in its first in-person competition this weekend for the first time in TWO YEARS.

Hosted by FIRST Washington, a live stream is available here:

[https://www.twitch.tv/firstinspires29](https://www.twitch.tv/firstinspires29)

![HERMES Robot Team 4915](../../assets/posts/live-stream-from-bellevue-sat-march-19-sun-mar-20/4915-1-1.jpg)

Hosted at Sammamish High School in Bellevue, you can find more details on FIRST Washington's website here:

[https://bit.ly/sammamish-info](https://bit.ly/sammamish-info)

https://firstwa.org/event/sammamish-hs-frc-event/

GO SPARTRONICS!
